                                                "example_id": "b0f10770-063d-4e2c-bbd3-5ecbc8061d1c",
                                                "sense_id": "a24056ef-b0b2-3542-a14e-0027085ca063",
                                                "text": "\"You surely are a man of some weight around here,\" I said."
