                                                "sense_id": "c392b71f-d4a0-346f-9318-a34cc0ace562",
                                                "text": "He was pushing weight."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff7ecaa0-89db-4b3f-aac1-78f8fdcdabb7",
                                                "sense_id": "c392b71f-d4a0-346f-9318-a34cc0ace562",
                                                "text": "The three of us were hanging out rapping in Hamilton projects with some niggahs Pimp had got tight with on Rikers Island. Them fools had done a push-in and took over some old lady's apartment, and they were in there cutting crack and mixing weight."
                                            }
